WEBVTT

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.070
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.190
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.880
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.640
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:58.320
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.100
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.760
With you guys

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.900
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.340
If we join forces

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:12.340
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.940
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:23.520
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.020
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.100
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.100
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.100
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.340
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:45.340
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:49.340
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.200
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.160
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.100
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.160
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:12.390
Toriko and Starjun's mortal combat 
reached its ultimate stage.

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:18.540
In the middle of the chaos, a suspicious 
figure arrived at the Fest... Joie!

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:22.920
Teppei, of all people, was 
taking orders from Joie.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.600
And even Setsuno proved to be inferior

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:30.350
to Joie's extraordinary strength.

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:35.340
In the end, can they escape 
these dire straits?!

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.360
Shock! The True Identity 
of the Mastermind, "Joie"!

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:03.430
He appeared at last...

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:09.160
Looks like Starjun has noticed somethin'.

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:13.640
This sense I have... What 
the hell is happenin'?!

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:26.420
It's been Knocked.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:30.200
The Nitro was sent flying 
backwards with one finger.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:33.150
And at the same time, it can't move.

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:36.630
A technique with such destructive power

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:38.320
and yet delicacy...

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:43.030
Sorry I'm late, Se-chan.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.580
Not at all, Jiro-chan...

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.510
Your coming here is a huge help.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.790
What the hell are you doin',

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:08.090
Teppei?!

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:20.200
What a shout...

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:23.880
There ain't anybody in my 
hometown with pipes like that.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:28.200
It's gotta be Knocking Master Jiro...

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.950
The old Daruma man told me about him.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:33.700
He's one of the three most 
powerful people in the world!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.530
A fitting move for Knocking Master Jiro.

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:47.660
Long ago, Acacia was concerned 
about that great power

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:50.470
and violent nature most of all,

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:54.060
and so sealed off part of that brute strength

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:56.820
by implanting a technique into the Wolf...

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.410
The Savage Creature...

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:01.640
The Rampaging Beast...

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.240
Jiro!

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.950
Before becoming Acacia's disciple,

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:11.830
you <i>were</i> called those names, weren't you?

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:15.670
Well, well. You've done your homework.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:19.730
I know more than that.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:24.740
Your fellow disciples, Ichiryu and Midora...

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:26.980
I know about them, too.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.280
Right now, those two

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:34.750
must be enjoying their reunion 
in the Gourmet World.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.840
As if they've lost a destination,

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.630
these islands float continuously in the air.

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:52.280
Rogue Islands.

00:05:56.820 --> 00:05:59.070
This will make an ideal graveyard,

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:00.970
old man.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:04.720
Why don't we talk this over,

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:06.480
Midora?

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:10.080
We will, old man. With fists.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.720
It's begun!

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:06.080
Resident Beasts of Rogue Island...

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.310
I suppose even strays get hungry.

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:24.660
Many kinds of creatures in the Gourmet 
World have Capture Levels that change.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.240
Before battling me,

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:30.630
see that you don't get eaten, old man.

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:34.980
Quit babbling, brat!

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:50.810
Gravity, as always...

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:53.550
It makes even the Beasts 
of Rogue Island surrender.

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:56.220
It's not only gravity.

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:16.290
I wonder how long it's been 
since I last used Chopsticks...

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:19.110
It seems the Human World is in chaos, too.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:22.330
I have to settle things here quickly.

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:26.180
No more playing, Midora!

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.040
Old man...

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:31.530
Become my prey.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:39.730
Who the hell are you?

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:43.140
Wha...?

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:46.350
Se-chan... That's...

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:51.580
Yes. The legendary Cinderella.

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:55.750
Knocking Master Jiro...

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:58.430
It would be a shame

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.820
to crush someone as powerful as you.

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:03.140
So how about this?

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:07.520
Why don't you become a 
member of my organization?

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:11.530
Are you stupid?

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:18.610
Grand Knocking!

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:40.390
Everybody's bein' noisy, so you all stop!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:44.250
W-What is this?!

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:49.330
I can't... move my body... 
even one millimeter.

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:52.000
I-It can't be...

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.570
The entire island...

00:09:55.240 --> 00:10:00.010
He knocked all of our movements too?!

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:03.670
T-The island...?

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:06.420
That's just a cute little range.

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:11.090
For a moment, I thought the 
entire world had stopped.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:14.720
That's how powerful his Knocking is.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.630
H-How...?

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.390
I don't believe it!

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:29.820
He can move?!

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.510
W-What the...?!

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:35.860
What is that?!

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:46.980
It really did stop, didn't it?

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:49.210
The rotation of the Earth, in an instant...

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:53.760
Or perhaps I should say 
that you <i>began</i> to stop it.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:58.040
Because of that, abnormal tectonic 
movements are occurring.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:00.520
You're a monster, aren't you?

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.070
Even retired...

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:15.420
Show me who you really are!

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.780
W-What?!

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.790
F-Froese-sama!

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:57.000
W-What?!

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:00.860
Froese-sama is...

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:03.670
I-I don't believe it!

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.360
Welcome home.

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:16.680
Is it good?

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:18.990
I'm glad.

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:21.360
There's a lot left,

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:23.650
so eat your fill.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:31.260
Along with Acacia-sensei...

00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:34.500
...the one who raised us!

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:36.990
Froese-sama is...

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.370
It can't be!

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:57.090
Instant Shedding.

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:13.100
God Cooking, Air Cut!

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:39.890
That technique...

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:41.470
...is Froese-sama's!

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:45.640
Let's confirm it, Jiro-chan.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.270
Gotcha.

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:49.940
Form Change!

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.650
Takitsuba!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.350
Wolf King's Fangs!

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.130
The road of good flavor that 
even reaches the heavens!

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:10.460
Cook Road!

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:15.970
Ascend to devour the stars!

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:20.470
Climbing Wolf Guinness Punch!

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:43.630
Satan Mince!

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:59.040
Did you see that, Jiro-chan?

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:00.230
Yeah...

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:04.040
Her Gourmet Cells showed themselves.

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:10.150
She's made the power of her 
cells completely her own.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.470
In other words,

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:16.540
she's eaten Acacia-sama's Full Course.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:21.190
Other than Acacia-sama and Froese-sama,

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.470
is there anyone on this Earth

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:28.370
who has eaten that Full Course?

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:30.460
I suppose that must be...

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.650
No.

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:34.980
That's not Froese-sama.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:39.320
Certainly, Froese-sama's cooking technique

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:41.920
used Gourmet Cells.

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:45.370
But when Froese-sama cooked,

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:47.680
her form changed.

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:51.080
It's obviously different from that.

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:55.800
But more than anything, Froese-sama...

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:58.570
...is dead.

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:00.110
Yeah...

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:28.070
Then what the hell is that?!

00:16:28.270 --> 00:16:31.670
What is that creature?!

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:39.300
Die!

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:57.760
It seems that fighting alongside 
Gourmet Hunters has been effective.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.300
Se-chan!

00:17:25.050 --> 00:17:26.160
Jiro-chan!

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:30.200
As expected, even Knocking Master Jirou

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:34.170
is having a hard time fighting 
while protecting Setsuno.

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.620
And it ends... like this!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.520
Setsuno!

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:55.410
Jiro-chan!

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:58.060
Cannon Fork!

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:17.560
Toriko!

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:17.840
Toriko-kun!

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:25.090
Ow...

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:28.330
Komatsu-kun, too!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:31.920
I never thought I'd see you 
two in over your heads.

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:40.000
Well, well...

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:43.230
Toriko, one of the Four 
Kings Gourmet Hunters...

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:47.420
And a Vice-chef of Gourmet Corp...

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:51.240
Number two when it comes to power...

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:52.680
Starjun.

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:55.320
We meet at last.

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:58.370
You know, I noticed the presence

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:00.690
of you and your friends.

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:04.600
And that you've been 
around for a long time...

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:08.340
Joe Joe is a member of 
your group too, isn't he?

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:10.960
As are many others...

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:14.830
You've infiltrated us with sloppy spies.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:19.430
To us, Toriko and his ilk weren't the people

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:22.810
that we considered to 
be the unfortunate ones.

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:34.220
Anyway, I'm glad that chef is still alive.

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:38.320
Would you hand him over to me?

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.730
What's that supposed to mean?

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:56.770
Teppei-san!

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.560
Toriko!

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:04.580
Teppei is being mind-controlled!

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:29.440
Even in a world that nobody's ever seen

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:35.040
There's something that can be 
glimpsed if you keep chasing dreams

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:40.720
Flowers don't bloom on top of asphalt

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:45.860
Come on, let's go make 
only your dreams come true

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:51.640
Mega Raba! The map that you 
draw spreads out into infinity

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:57.380
Mega Raba! Nobody can stop you

00:20:57.380 --> 00:21:03.500
Mega Raba! Let's go forth, 
feeling excitement in our hearts

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:08.800
Let's go find what you've been longing for

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:10.040
Mega Raba

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:12.940
Mega Raba

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:16.000
Mega Raba

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:23.530
Guess the Legend
The Legend Gourmet Quiz

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:23.330
Guess the Legend
The Legend Gourmet Quiz

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.360
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:29.250
This is a heaping helping 
of an epoch-making segment,

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:32.130
in which you guess the legendary 
ingredients of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:39.490
Today's "Really?!" level is 10!

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:41.550
Really?! Level 10

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:41.550
Someone once said...

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:44.930
Heavenly voice! Please help me today too!

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:47.650
Sure, sure. Okay, here I go.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:50.920
Really?! Level 8

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:50.920
Someone once said...

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:56.200
There's a kind of pig that soars 
through the air like a helicopter...

00:21:56.570 --> 00:21:59.430
Something!

00:21:59.430 --> 00:22:02.130
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:03.830
Start!

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:06.590
Helicopter? Pig?

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:10.210
Do you know the kind of pig 
that's raised on acorns?

00:22:10.210 --> 00:22:12.300
Iberian Pigs.

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:16.020
Iberian pork, Iberianpork, Iberipork...

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:19.270
Someone once said...

00:22:16.890 --> 00:22:28.260
Iberiporkter

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:22.950
There's a kind of pig that soars 
through the air like a helicopter...

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:26.280
Iberiporkter!

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:31.330
I see! Iberiporkter, is it?

00:22:31.330 --> 00:22:34.030
Well, I thought that one up.

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:36.180
You did, heavenly voice?

00:22:36.180 --> 00:22:39.590
Yeah, since this is the last 
time we're doing this segment.

00:22:39.590 --> 00:22:41.410
Thank you for the meal!

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:43.490
And now on to our next segment.
